  "stem": "<!--版权声明：试题（含题干、答案、解析）由学科网授权提供，受版权保护--><div class=\"qml-stem\" data-copyright=\"xkw.com-1791861841-114651791852237200-wRCPENZYe7_2Homr0ISr213mQaaskpJnYM-9XZSE4M6Q0lBahP9DfzkbnkdavWLO\"><p style=\"text-align:justify;word-break:break-word;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">镍磷化合物</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/2319cd2bf0f5ce03023f0cd9ac4700ac.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">晶态结构多样、导电性良好、离子传输通道丰富，在储能领域极具应用前景。</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/004d5c84e9636ffab4f1825ea166307d.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">为阿伏加德罗常数的值。据此完成下面小题。</span></p><div class=\"qml-sq\"><div class=\"qml-stem\" data-copyright=\"xkw.com-1791861841-114651791852237200-wRCPENZYe7_2Homr0ISr213mQaaskpJnYM-9XZSE4M6Q0lBahP9DfzkbnkdavWLO\"><p style=\"\"><span class=\"ques-no\">1. </span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">某</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/47badeec95b92a2d77760c2d3c1c907c.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">的立方晶胞结构如下图，已知晶胞参数为</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/b6cc072451382ae5064c16134965fecb.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。下列说法正确的是</span></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;word-break:break-word;\"><img  height=\"150\" src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/QBM/editorImg/2026/9/21/98f7a7d6-acbf-4b41-8cc1-5914a89dd23d.png\" width=\"416\" /></p><div class=\" qml-og\"><table class=\"qml-og\" style=\"width:100%\"><tr><td>A.&nbsp;<span class=\"qml-op\"><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/1779211e94c682160e12eb076d3e3c8b.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /></span></td></tr><tr><td>B.&nbsp;<span class=\"qml-op\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">与</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">个</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/64d5454f4a6ea5d8aeca9cb335ceee7b.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">最紧邻的</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/0c27eda162792128da25f541303a3088.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">有</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">6</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">个</span></span></td></tr><tr><td>C.&nbsp;<span class=\"qml-op\"><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/64d5454f4a6ea5d8aeca9cb335ceee7b.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">之间最短的距离为</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/087f96487b43673cf5caa6cc59076e9e.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /></span></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\">D.&nbsp;<span class=\"qml-op\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">晶体密度</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/e6d954acbcf6ffc216fe4133ec2276d3.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /></span></td></tr></table></div></div></div><div class=\"qml-sq\"><div class=\"qml-stem\" data-copyright=\"xkw.com-1791861841-114651791852237200-wRCPENZYe7_2Homr0ISr213mQaaskpJnYM-9XZSE4M6Q0lBahP9DfzkbnkdavWLO\"><p style=\"\"><span class=\"ques-no\">2. </span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">我国科研人员用碳纳米管负载碳包覆的</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/47badeec95b92a2d77760c2d3c1c907c.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">为</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/581c04af30b490da1a50555f9c89125c.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">电极材料，以提高电池（如下图）寿命。下列说法正确的是</span></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;word-break:break-word;\"><img  height=\"187\" src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/QBM/editorImg/2026/9/21/92897d39-e199-49b0-9028-5fdfaa17aca6.png\" width=\"301\" /></p><div class=\" qml-og\"><table class=\"qml-og\" style=\"width:100%\"><tr><td>A.&nbsp;<span class=\"qml-op\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">充电时，</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/fc2a39beea5adf5d07aea0424ca7a64f.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">极外接电源正极</span></span></td></tr><tr><td>B.&nbsp;<span class=\"qml-op\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">放电时，</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/581c04af30b490da1a50555f9c89125c.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">极的电极反应为</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/038aa6a8f9797e8a295f0270b39b6b46.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /></span></td></tr><tr><td>C.&nbsp;<span class=\"qml-op\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">玻璃纤维膜主要作用是利于</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/26e584eee3da3c737f9ecce2800ebec5.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">迁移</span></span></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\">D.&nbsp;<span class=\"qml-op\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">外电路通过</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/004d5c84e9636ffab4f1825ea166307d.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">个</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/3f5afd1d6e13ff0b0c885a3760a65610.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，电解质溶液质量理论上变化</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/c1569236e57b3c92210ab17b8342a75f.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /></span></td></tr></table></div></div></div></div>",
  "answer": "<!--版权声明：试题（含题干、答案、解析）由学科网授权提供，受版权保护--><div class=\"qml-answer\" data-copyright=\"xkw.com-1791861841-114651791852237200-wRCPENZYe7_2Homr0ISr213mQaaskpJnYM-9XZSE4M6Q0lBahP9DfzkbnkdavWLO\">1. <span class=\"qml-an-sq\"><span class=\"qml-an qml-isop \">B</span></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;2. <span class=\"qml-an-sq\"><span class=\"qml-an qml-isop \">A</span></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</div>",
  "explanation": "<!--版权声明：试题（含题干、答案、解析）由学科网授权提供，受版权保护--><div class=\"qml-explanation\" data-copyright=\"xkw.com-1791861841-114651791852237200-wRCPENZYe7_2Homr0ISr213mQaaskpJnYM-9XZSE4M6Q0lBahP9DfzkbnkdavWLO\"><div class=\"qml-exps-sq\">(1)题详解： <p style=\"\"><span>A．根据均摊法，晶胞中</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/aed1ec35a40cbec4bc96209ec88a9f56.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span>位于顶点和面心，数目为</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/cd1ae6c641ab703cf8272c5d07ac5727.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span>，</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/60051144e33707f6aa51b2fe09925268.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span>全部位于晶胞内部，共8个，故</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/f4c7c970ab44a4aa1a6c5f288f4bbd14.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span>，A错误；</span></p><p style=\"\"><span>B．观察晶胞结构可知，1个</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/aed1ec35a40cbec4bc96209ec88a9f56.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span>最紧邻的</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/60051144e33707f6aa51b2fe09925268.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span>有6个，B正确；</span></p><p style=\"\"><span>C．</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/aed1ec35a40cbec4bc96209ec88a9f56.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span>之间最短距离为晶胞面对角线的</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/e244c12208e7c6a01e3580d1ae9d7544.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span>，即</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/1a35d6af398d60c3dead052b25120d7f.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span>，C错误；</span></p><p style=\"\"><span>D．晶胞中含4个</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/7a88cec02b1d41d939e1fc6f37337d34.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span>结构单元，故晶体密度</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/5b490c7fb39fb5d263e5a52ea2c770ab.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span>，D错误；</span></p><p style=\"\"><span>故选B。</span></p></div><div class=\"qml-exps-sq\">(2)题详解： <p style=\"\"><span>A．充电时，a极</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/a6431238983af950627f668bbea7a652.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span>转化为</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/d6e0d7f3c9d68256367857dd81a1802b.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span>和</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/126e8720c49a7ad1c2f97c36460a2be0.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span>，</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/dea4f28c3689adbe9ec6616612c2abc0.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span>元素化合价升高，发生氧化反应，为阳极，外接电源正极，A正确；</span></p><p style=\"\"><span>B．放电时a极发生还原反应为正极，故b极为负极，发生失电子的氧化反应，选项给出的是得电子的还原反应，对应充电时b极的反应，B错误；</span></p><p style=\"\"><span>C．玻璃纤维膜为电池隔膜，主要作用是隔离正负极防止短路，允许</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/126e8720c49a7ad1c2f97c36460a2be0.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span>通过是其性质而非主要作用，C错误；</span></p><p style=\"\"><span>D．外电路通过</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/2d06ca60c3e769c76140569995fedc0d.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span>个</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/e382e5a0368d8410c625f157e7016929.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span>时，仅</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/9621f4916916a1fdfdd0193e4980e066.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span>在电解质中定向迁移，电解质溶液中</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/126e8720c49a7ad1c2f97c36460a2be0.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span>总量不变，溶液质量无变化，D错误；</span></p><p style=\"\"><span>故选A。</span></p></div></div>",
